<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia June trade deficit at 2.8 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia June trade deficit at 2.8 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia recorded a trade deficit of 2.8 million ringgit in June against a surplus of 156.2 million in May, the Statistics Department said on Monday.</p>
</text>
